Suppose it can be colored as requested:
If the red area has white  $a's$  and black  $b's$  $\Rightarrow$ The black area has  $995\times 995-a$  white cells and  $995\times 995-b$  black cells $\Rightarrow$ The blue area has  $a$  white cells and  $b$  black cells
But for the property: $\Rightarrow$ The blue area has  $a$  black cells and  $b$  white cells $\Rightarrow a=b$ In the red zone there are  $995^2$  cells: $\Rightarrow a+b=2a=995^2\equiv 0\pmod{2} (\Rightarrow \Leftarrow)$  $\Rightarrow$  So it cannot be colored as requested  $_\blacksquare$

