Let  $y_i = \frac{1}{1+x_i}$ . We have  $0 < y_i < 1$  and  $\frac{1}{y_i} - 1 = x_i$ , so  $\prod_{i=1}^n \left(\frac{1}{y_i} - 1\right) = 1$ , so  $\prod_{i=1}^n (1 - y_i) = \prod_{i=1}^n y_i$ . Hence,  $\prod_{i=1}^n y_i^2 = \prod_{i=1}^n y_i (1 - y_i) \geq \frac{1}{4^n}$  by AM-GM, so  $\prod_{i=1}^n y_i \geq \frac{1}{2^n}$ . Therefore, by another application of AM-GM, we have 
